ever need.
所有工具包。

1246
01:01:28.290 --> 01:01:29.610
You know I'm on that.
你知道我一直在关注这个。

1247
01:01:29.990 --> 01:01:31.150
Oh, I know.
哦，我知道。

1248
01:01:31.150 --> 01:01:33.510
I was like, oh, Paul, there's some good stuff on here.
我当时就想，哦，保罗，这里面有些好东西。

1249
01:01:33.590 --> 01:01:35.010
Christmas gift for me.
作为我的圣诞礼物。

1250
01:01:35.190 --> 01:01:35.890
Earmark that.
把它标记出来。

1251
01:01:37.230 --> 01:01:39.530
Survival and emergency kits and products.
生存与应急工具包及相关产品。

1252
01:01:39.750 --> 01:01:39.930
Jenna.
珍娜。

1253
01:01:40.510 --> 01:01:42.090
We'll see you next week, everyone.
各位，我们下周见。

1254
01:01:42.330 --> 01:01:43.290
See you next week.
下周见。

